    "_postman_id": "a9b8c7d6-e5f4-3210-abcd-academicgroup01",
    "name": "univ-v2-academic-group",
    "description": "Academic Group formation APIs (stepwise wizard).\n\n**Docs:** `docs/postman/ACADEMIC_GROUP.md`\n\n## Create order\n1. `POST /academicGroup/scope` → `academicGroupScopeId`\n2. `POST /academicGroup` → `academicGroupId`\n3. `POST /academicGroup/user` → faculty\n4. `POST /academicGroup/student` → students\n\nThen PATCH/GET/DELETE as needed.\n\n## Pickers\n- `GET /options/studentFilters`\n- `GET /student/all`\n- `GET /options/teachers`\n\nSet `baseurl` + `token`. Tenant from `saveUserDefaults`.\n\n**Note:** when `academicContextType` is `course`, send `contextSubjectId` (subject FK), not a course id.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseurl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "academicGroupScopeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "academicGroupId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "academicGroupUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "academicGroupStudentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "courseId", "value": "34" },
    { "key": "sessionId", "value": "6" },
    { "key": "term", "value": "10" },
    { "key": "contextSubjectId", "value": "114" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "56" },
    { "key": "studentId", "value": "101" }
